IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ohs-dates`
IMPORT `ohs-core`
IMPORT `ohs-seat`

-- Occupational Health and Safety Act 2004 (Vic) -- cases for the seat of the person at work: duties (ss 21, 23, 25,
-- 32, 34), consultation (s 35), incidents (ss 37-39), workplace manslaughter (Part 5A) and penalties (ss 21-39G, 76,
-- 139, 144, 145, 148A, 148B, 153). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text (Version No. 045),
-- with the section in the comment; none was copied from the encoding's output.
--
-- BASELINE. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

GIVEN `dd` IS A NUMBER
      `mm` IS A NUMBER
      `yy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`d` `dd` `mm` `yy` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY `dd` `mm` `yy`

-- ss 5, 5A, 21(3): who is owed the s 21 duty.
-- Inputs: contract of employment, labour hire, labour hire excluded, contractor, matter within control.
#ASSERT `Does my employer owe me the s 21 duty` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my employer owe me the s 21 duty` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my employer owe me the s 21 duty` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does my employer owe me the s 21 duty` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does my employer owe me the s 21 duty` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Does my employer owe me the s 21 duty` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ss 20, 21(1)-(2), 152. Inputs after the five above: s 152 compliance, failures (a)-(e), eliminated, elimination
-- reasonably practicable, reduced so far as reasonably practicable.
-- Employee, no failure, risk eliminated: no contravention.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 21(2)(e) failure to train: a contravention.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 20(1)(a): elimination was reasonably practicable but not done.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 20(1)(b): elimination not reasonably practicable, risk reduced so far as reasonably practicable.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 20(1)(b): elimination not reasonably practicable, risk not reduced.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 152: complied with a compliance code for the duty although an (a) failure is alleged.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Labour hire worker, (c) unsafe workplace.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Contractor on a matter outside the business's control: s 21(3)(b) does not reach it.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Neither employee nor contractor.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached its s 21 duty to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 23. Inputs: contract, labour hire, excluded, risk from the conduct, s 152, eliminated, RP to eliminate, reduced.
-- A visitor, risk from the business, elimination reasonably practicable and not done.
#ASSERT `Has the business breached its s 23 duty to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has the business breached its s 23 duty to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- An employee: s 21, not s 23.
#ASSERT `Has the business breached its s 23 duty to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A risk that did not arise from the conduct of the business.
#ASSERT `Has the business breached its s 23 duty to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A labour hire worker excluded from s 5A is not the business's employee; s 152 compliance.
#ASSERT `Has the business breached its s 23 duty to me` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 34: Part 3 confers no civil right of action.
#ASSERT `Does this Act give me a right to sue for the breach` `s 21(1) employer's duty to employees` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does this Act give me a right to sue for the breach` `s 32 reckless endangerment` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does this Act give me a right to sue for the breach` `s 35 duty to consult` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Does this Act give me a right to sue for the breach` `s 76 discrimination offence` EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 25. Inputs: at work, own care, others' care, co-operation, misuse.
#ASSERT `Have I breached my duties as an employee` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Have I breached my duties as an employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Have I breached my duties as an employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Have I breached my duties as an employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 32. Inputs: lawful excuse, reckless, danger of serious injury.
#ASSERT `Is reckless endangerment made out` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is reckless endangerment made out` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is reckless endangerment made out` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 35(1), (4).
#ASSERT `Must my employer consult me` `identifying or assessing hazards or risks` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer consult me` `a thing prescribed by the regulations` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer consult me` `something else` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Must my employer consult me` `deciding measures to control risks` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Must the consultation involve my representative` `proposing changes to the workplace, plant, substances or conduct of work that may affect health or safety` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must the consultation involve my representative` `proposing changes to the workplace, plant, substances or conduct of work that may affect health or safety` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the consultation involve my representative` `something else` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ss 37, 38(1)-(2). Inputs: outcome, excluded, workplace under management and control, aware, only the duty-holder harmed.
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `an injury, consequence, event, circumstance or illness prescribed by the regulations` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `none of these` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `immediate treatment as a hospital in-patient` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `serious risk from an immediate or imminent exposure to the fall or release from a height of plant, a substance or a thing` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `serious risk from an immediate or imminent exposure to an escape, spillage or leakage of a substance` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must WorkSafe be notified of the incident` `immediate treatment as a hospital in-patient` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))

-- s 38(3): written record within 48 hours. Inputs after the five above: given, hours to the record, hours since aware.
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 48 60 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 49 60 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE 10 60 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 30 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 48 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 49 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the incident record given in time` `none of these` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 100 EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 38(4): record given 10 March 2026; kept at least 5 years, to 10 March 2031.
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a person injured in the incident, or exposed to serious risk by it` TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a person injured in the incident, or exposed to serious risk by it` TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 10 3 2031) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a person injured in the incident, or exposed to serious risk by it` TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 11 3 2031) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a representative of a person whose death the incident caused` FALSE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a health and safety representative for my designated work group` TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a health and safety representative for my designated work group` FALSE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `a member of the employer's health and safety committee` TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I see the incident record` `someone else` TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 1 4 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 39. Inputs after the five notification inputs: inspector arrived, directed time come, protective purpose.
#ASSERT `May the incident site be disturbed` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `May the incident site be disturbed` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May the incident site be disturbed` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May the incident site be disturbed` `a death` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May the incident site be disturbed` `immediate treatment as a hospital in-patient` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Part 5A, s 39G(1). Inputs: duty, employee-not-officer, deceased in class, conduct began, volunteer, great falling
-- short, high risk, breached, caused.
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 7 2020) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 187(2): conduct begun the day before Part 5A was inserted is taken to be before it.
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 30 6 2020) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 23 duty to other persons` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 39B(a): the s 25 duty is not an applicable duty.
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 25 employee's duty` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 39B(b): s 32 is applicable unless the duty-holder is an employee and not an officer.
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 32 duty not to recklessly endanger` TRUE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 32 duty not to recklessly endanger` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A volunteer; no great falling short; no high risk; no breach; no causation; the deceased outside the class.
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE TRUE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter` `s 21 duty to employees` FALSE FALSE (`d` 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 39G(2). Inputs: duty, deceased in class, entity kind, officer, conduct began, volunteer, short, risk, breached, caused.
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 21 duty to employees` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2024) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 21 duty to employees` TRUE TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2024) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 21 duty to employees` TRUE FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2024) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 32 duty not to recklessly endanger` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2024) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 25 employee's duty` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2024) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 21 duty to employees` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2024) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it workplace manslaughter by an officer` `s 21 duty to employees` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2019) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Maximum fines, as each section states them (penalty units).
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 21(1) employer's duty to employees` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 21(1) employer's duty to employees` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 22(1) employer's duty to monitor and inform` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 240
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 22(1) employer's duty to monitor and inform` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 22(2) employer's duty to keep records and engage advisers` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 60
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 22(2) employer's duty to keep records and engage advisers` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 23(1) employer's duty to other persons` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 24(1) self-employed person's duty` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 25(1) employee's duty of care and co-operation` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 25(2) employee's duty not to misuse safety equipment` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 26(1) duty of a person managing or controlling a workplace` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 27(1) designer of plant` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 28(1) designer of buildings or structures` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 28(1) designer of buildings or structures` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 2500
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 29(1) manufacturer of plant or substances` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 30(1) supplier of plant or substances` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 31(1) installer of plant` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 32 reckless endangerment` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 32 reckless endangerment` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 20000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 35 duty to consult` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 180
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 35 duty to consult` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 900
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 35A labour hire duty to consult other duty-holders` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 900
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 38 incident notification and record` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 240
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 38 incident notification and record` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 39(1) incident site preservation` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 39G(1) workplace manslaughter` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 100000
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 39G(1) workplace manslaughter` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 39G(2) workplace manslaughter by an officer` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 39G(2) workplace manslaughter by an officer` `a body corporate` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 73(2) employer's representative for issue resolution` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 76 discrimination offence` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 76 discrimination offence` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 2500
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 148B insuring or indemnifying a penalty` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 148B insuring or indemnifying a penalty` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 1500
#ASSERT `What is the most the court can fine` `s 153 false or misleading information` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 240

-- Maximum imprisonment (years).
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term` `s 32 reckless endangerment` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term` `s 39G(1) workplace manslaughter` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 25
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term` `s 39G(2) workplace manslaughter by an officer` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 25
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term` `s 21(1) employer's duty to employees` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term` `s 32 reckless endangerment` `a body corporate` EQUALS NOTHING

-- ss 144, 145. Inputs: entity contravened, failure of reasonable care, volunteer.
